Order Fulfillment Specialist / Orderpicker Timing 16-05-2024 
 - Locatie: Roosendaal 
 - Order Fulfillment Specialist / Orderpicker Timing 16-05-2024 
 Werken in Bergen op Zoom Introductie vacature 
Are you someone who enjoys connecting with customers and thrives on the excitement of physical work? If so, look no further! We are currently seeking an Orderpicker to join our fantastic, close-knit team. As an Orderpicker, you will be the heartbeat of our clients' logistics operations. Each day, you'll start with an energizing team, enjoying a delicious cup of coffee, and setting daily goals for success. Your main responsibility will be order picking, ensuring that the customers receive their goods with a big smile. As you progress within the company, you'll have the opportunity to become an all-around warehouse specialist, double-checking everything to ensure top-notch service. Join us on this exhilarating journey and apply now to grow together! 
Wij bieden: 
Here's what you can look forward to: - Dayshifts, ensuring you have your evenings free for leisure and relaxation; 
- Full-time work for the long term, providing stability and security in your career; 
- A salary based on your experience, recognizing and valuing your skills; 
- On-the-job training and coaching to help you reach your full potential; 
- Exciting growth opportunities that align with your unique skillset and aspirations; 
- Working alongside a friendly and supportive team that feels like family; 
But that's not all! As a Timing employee, you get to enjoy even more perks: - Choose between weekly or 4-weekly payments to suit your financial preferences; 
- Access to free online courses, empowering you to expand your knowledge and expertise. 
